Package: localflow
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: LocalFlow <releases@localflow.app>
Homepage: https://github.com/yonif8/LocalFlow
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libatomic1, libgcc-s1, libgomp1, libstdc++6, libx11-6, libxtst6, libatspi2.0-0
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils, wireplumber, wl-clipboard | xclip
Description: Private, fully local push-to-talk dictation
 LocalFlow transcribes, polishes, and inserts speech without uploading audio
 or text. This package includes the desktop application and its Qt runtime;
 desktop portals and audio services are supplied by the operating system.
